// M3fix-4 (b): a user .mid whose `call` names a key that resolves at J2 (the
// runtime EXPORT block's typed extern table) but names NO defun of this
// program.  Run under QBE_NOMIDRT=1 — the whole Mid Rt program withheld — so
// `Rt.read-file-as-string` (exported, hence J2-resolvable) has no defun
// behind it.  The compile MUST be REFUSED loudly naming the key: a RawCall
// to a key with no `q_` symbol to call is exactly the "call to nothing" the
// RawCall arm exists to stop (before M3fix-4 the refusal was the Rt.*-shape
// predicate; now it is membership in the set this compile EMITS).
module MissingTarget
export MissingTarget.bad : val -> val
defun MissingTarget.bad(dummy: val) -> val {
  return call Rt.read-file-as-string(dummy);
}
